Oriented Object Detection," arXiv:2602.03634, 2026.

Weak geometric supervision components are adapted from the public H2RBox-v2
and Point2RBox-v2 implementations. Their method names are retained here only
for source attribution; SWS-TER runtime modules use project-specific names.

